[Music]  young hollywood is mourning the death of  actor and model  daniel mickelson have a great day  [Music]  on monday daniel's sister and model  meredith mickelson  took to instagram to reveal her brother  had passed away  over 4th of july weekend he was 23 years  old  meredith writes in the caption to know  him was to love him he was the happiest  brightest smiley most sunshine human to  exist  and i'm so happy god chose me to be his  sister for his whole  amazing life  [Music]  details on what led to daniel's death  have not been revealed  but many of his famous friends have paid  tribute  stars like jordan woods and patrick  schwarzenegger offered their support to  meredith  writing praying for you along with  emilia hamlin who wrote  i love you forever daniel meanwhile  paris hilton and kaia gerber took to  their instagram stories  paris paid her respects writing you were  such a light  along with this video of their last  memory together  kaya gerber posted a heartfelt caption  in her insta story  reminiscing on when they came up with  their own secret language  i wish we could go back there i wish we  were still talking in sentences that  probably annoyed everyone else but made  us crack up  every time but the most touching tribute  was from daniel's girlfriend  maddie haley the two celebrated their  one year anniversary  in may  maddie credits daniel as her guardian  angel writing quote  i wish i could call you right now and  hear you tell me everything is going to  be okay  i wish my plans to spend the rest of my  life with you weren't stripped away from  me like this  i wish i could tell you how much i love  you and i wish i got the chance to say  goodbye  i'm not sure how i'm going to get  through this but i'm going to be strong  for you because i know it's what you  would have wanted  [Music]  i love you so much  [Music]  you

